          "lexical_score": 9.920821,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## How long we keep records\n\nWe keep adult medical records for 10 years after your last visit.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.4878689,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, and a staff member may join a conversation to help you. Do not use the chat to report a medical emergency: call 911 or go to the nearest emergency department.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.46834296,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 3.7097666,
          "lexical_rank": 7,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Registering as a new patient\n\nNew patients fill in three forms at their first visit:\n\n- Form PR-1, New Patient Registration: your contact details, emergency contact and insurance information;\n- Form PR-4, Medical History Questionnaire: your past illnesses, operations, current medicines and allergies;\n- Form HC-9, Consent to Treatment.\n\nYou can fill them in on the tablet at the self-check-in kiosk, or on paper at the front desk. Most people take about 10 minutes over them. Returning patients update Form PR-1 only when their details have changed, and complete Form PR-4 again once a year.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.44699448,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who handle billing for your visits. We share information from your record with your insurance company only as far as is needed to process claims for your care. We never share your health information with your employer, and we never sell it.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.44333506,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never the reason for the call or any health details.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.43000704,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": 7.3643413,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Recording a consultation\n\nYou may make an audio recording of your own consultation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you start. Staff and other patients must not be recorded or photographed.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.4114375,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Questions and complaints about privacy\n\nOur privacy officer answers questions about how your information is used and handles privacy complaints. Ask the f",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 37,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.4064324,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": 4.825565,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Long-term conditions\n\nIf you live with a long-term condition such as type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, asthma or COPD, your GP will agree a regular review schedule with you, usually every three or six months. Bring your home blood pressure or blood glucose readings to each review, and bring your inhalers if you have asthma or COPD, so the GP can check your technique.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.40427446,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Changing your phone number or email address\n\nTell the front desk at check-in, or update the contact section of Form PR-1 at the self-check-in ki",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.40257624,
          "dense_rank": 10,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always c",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.39404246,
          "dense_rank": 11,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Email\n\nWe use email only to confirm a new appointment and to send an itemized receipt you have asked for. We do not send test results or medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 32,
