          "similarity_score": 0.38383695,
          "dense_rank": 12,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Vaccinations\n## After your vaccination\n\nPlease stay in the waiting area for 15 minutes after any vaccination, so staff can help if you feel faint or have an allergic reaction. A sore arm for a day o",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 28,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.36672878,
          "dense_rank": 13,
          "lexical_score": 3.0132115,
          "lexical_rank": 9,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 31,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.3658768,
          "dense_rank": 14,
          "lexical_score": 4.428477,
          "lexical_rank": 4,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n## Urine sample\n\nIf you have been asked to bring a urine sample, collect a sterile container from the front desk beforehand; household containers can contaminate th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 21,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3643934,
          "dense_rank": 15,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.3629123,
          "dense_rank": 16,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank details, Social Security number or insurance member ID by text message",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.3609246,
          "dense_rank": 17,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## A code you do not recognise\n\nIf your receipt shows a code that is not in this list, the front desk can tell you what it is.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.35983545,
          "dense_rank": 18,
          "lexical_score": 2.9391363,
          "lexical_rank": 12,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or ty",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 31,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.35890874,
          "dense_rank": 19,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n\nSome tests are done at the clinic during a regular appointment. This guide explains how to prepare for each of them. If your doctor has given you different instruc",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 7,
          "similarity_score": 0.3559988,
          "dense_rank": 20,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Updating your insurance\n\nIf your insurance has changed since your last visit, tell the front desk at check-in and fill in Form IC-2, the Insurance Update Form, so the claim g",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.353126,
          "dense_rank": 21,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minutes behind, the front desk will tell you w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.33552068,
          "dense_rank": 22,
          "lexical_score": 3.306246,
          "lexical_rank": 8,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered Mo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.33194107,
          "dense_rank": 23,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n\nYour itemized receipt lists each procedure done at your visit by its billing code. Medical procedures use five-digit CPT codes, and dental procedures use CDT cod",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
