          "similarity_score": 0.33144945,
          "dense_rank": 24,
          "lexical_score": 2.9536583,
          "lexical_rank": 11,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 24,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.32073337,
          "dense_rank": 25,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insu",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 31,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 4.3048277,
          "lexical_rank": 5,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n## 24-hour blood pressure monitoring\n\nFor ambulatory blood pressure monitoring you wear a cuff on your upper arm, connected to a small recorder on a belt, for 24 ho",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 31,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 3.756876,
          "lexical_rank": 6,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n## Spirometry (breathing test)\n\nSpirometry measures how much air you can breathe out, and how fast. You will blow hard into a mouthpiece several times while sitting",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 32,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 2.9536583,
          "lexical_rank": 10,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Vaccinations\n## Seasonal flu vaccine\n\nWe give the flu vaccine every year from the start of September until the end of March. Patients aged 65 and over are offered a high-dose vaccine (Fluzone High-D",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
